================================================================================
2. CONTENT AND MEDIA - All rights reserved
================================================================================

Applies to everything else in this repository, wherever it sits. This is the
default: if something is not clearly software under Section 1, it is here.

It includes, without limiting the generality of that:

  - `content/`   - blog posts and project write-ups
  - `public/`    - ALL of it, including photographs, video, illustrations and
                   generated cover art, the resume PDF, icons, and brand assets
  - `emails/`    - email templates and campaign HTML
  - `docs/`      - specifications, plans, notes, and design documentation
  - `brand/`     - brand definition and design tokens
  - root documentation such as `README.md` and the agent instruction files
  - the prose embedded in source files, as described in Section 1

