--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
A note on what this file can and cannot do
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is public on GitHub. GitHub's Terms of Service grant every GitHub
user a licence to view public repositories and to reproduce them by forking,
"solely on GitHub as permitted through GitHub's functionality". That grant comes
from making the repository public and is not overridden by this file - but it is
also limited to GitHub, and expressly conveys no right to use this material
anywhere else. Section 2 continues to apply everywhere outside that.

This file states my position. It is not a technical control.
